<div class="ComponentRenderer-module__v_z8Aa__box"><div class="Container-module__CrcPyG__root"><div class="Row-module__3KxSla__root"><div class="Column-module__sVh1-q__column"><div class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__splitContainer SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__reversedDirection"><div class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__splitImageBlock"><div class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__aspectRatioBox"><img alt="" title="" loading="lazy" width="824" height="464" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__splitImage" style="color:transparent" src="https://tork-images.essity.com/images-c5/813/550813/original/a-man-polishing-pary-factory-16to9.png"/></div></div><div class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__splitContentBlock"><h2 class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__splitTitle">&quot;Tork hat uns nicht nur dabei geholfen, den Abfall zu reduzieren, sondern auch die Effizienz am Arbeitsplatz zu steigern.&quot;</h2><div class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__brandContainer"><div class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__brandText"><span class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__brandPerson">Dragomir Alin</span><span class="SplitTestimonialCard-module__hUo6Ba__brandPosition">Leitung der Produktabteilung, Leoni Wiring Systems Arad</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ComponentRenderer-module__v_z8Aa__box"><div class="Container-module__CrcPyG__root"><div class="Row-module__3KxSla__root PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__promoTextCardContainer"><div class="Column-module__sVh1-q__column Column-module__sVh1-q__s-4"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__cardWrapper"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__cardMain"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__percentageArea"><h2 class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__highlightNumber">110</h2><span class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__symbol"></span></div><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__subheading">Die Anzahl der Länder, in denen Tork erhältlich ist</div></div></div></div><div class="Column-module__sVh1-q__column Column-module__sVh1-q__s-4"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__cardWrapper"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__cardMain"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__percentageArea"><h2 class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__highlightNumber">6.0+</h2><span class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__symbol"></span></div><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__subheading">Millionen Spender werden jedes Jahr platziert</div></div></div></div><div class="Column-module__sVh1-q__column Column-module__sVh1-q__s-4"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__cardWrapper"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__cardMain"><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__percentageArea"><h2 class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__highlightNumber">27.000</h2><span class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__symbol"></span></div><div class="PromoCardTextCollection-module__fthC1a__subheading">Befragte Kunden</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ComponentRenderer-module__v_z8Aa__box"><div class="FullWidthContainer-module__GLHnaa__root FullWidthContainer-module__GLHnaa__regionVariant"><div class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__bannerContainer FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__inner FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__cyan"><div class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__overlayRight"></div><div class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__overlayBottom"></div><div class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__contentBanner FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__darkContent"><img alt="" title="" loading="lazy" width="824" height="464" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://tork-images.essity.com/images-c5/507/552507/original/globe-in-hands-eec9-21-9.png"/></div><div class="Container-module__CrcPyG__root FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__pageContainer"><div class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__bannerCardContainer"><div class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__bannerCard FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__innerDark"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 32 32" class="Icon-module__evTtOa__l Icon-module__evTtOa__neutral"><path fill="#036" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M24.86 22.962H7.9c-1.92-.64-3.2-2.4-3.2-4.24 0-1.92 1.12-3.28 3.2-3.92.4-.08.56-.4.56-.72-.16-2.96 1.84-4.8 3.84-5.28 1.84-.48 4.48 0 5.76 2.8.16.32.56.48.88.4 1.76-.56 3.36-.32 4.48.64 1.04.88 1.52 2.4 1.28 3.92-.08.32.08.64.4.8 1.28.56 2.08 1.68 2 2.88s-.96 2.24-2.24 2.72m-17.04 1.44h17.44c1.92-.56 3.28-2.24 3.36-4.08.08-1.68-.8-3.2-2.4-4.08.16-1.84-.56-3.6-1.84-4.72-1.36-1.2-3.28-1.6-5.28-1.12a6.42 6.42 0 0 0-7.2-3.04c-2.48.64-4.96 2.8-4.96 6.24-2.32.88-3.76 2.8-3.76 5.12 0 2.56 1.84 4.88 4.4 5.68zm4.801-7.2v-1.52h-2.64c-.72 0-1.36.64-1.36 1.28v3.76c0 .64.64 1.2 1.28 1.2h2.64v-1.44h-1.92c-.24 0-.4-.16-.4-.4v-2.4c0-.24.16-.48.4-.48zm10.478 4.72h-4.16v-2.4c0-.64.56-1.44 1.36-1.44h.64c.4 0 .56-.96 0-.96h-2.08v-1.52h2.64c1.2 0 1.6.88 1.6 1.92s-.4 1.92-2.48 2.24v.72h2.48zm-6.479-4.4v2.64c0 .16-.08.32-.24.32h-1.04c-.08 0-.24-.16-.24-.32v-2.64c0-.16.08-.32.24-.32h1.04c.08 0 .24.16.24.32m-3.12 2.96c0 .64.64 1.44 1.36 1.44h2c.72 0 1.36-.8 1.36-1.44v-3.6c0-.64-.64-1.2-1.36-1.2h-2c-.72 0-1.36.56-1.36 1.2z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><h2 class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__heading">Gut fürs Geschäft. Besser für Mensch und Umwelt.</h2><div class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__bannerCta"><div class="RichTextField-module__13JUJa__rtf FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__bodyText"><div>Wir bei Tork haben uns der Verbesserung der Hygienestandards mit nachhaltigen Lösungen verschrieben. Wir verfolgen einen kreislauforientierten Ansatz, um die Kohlenstoffbelastung zu senken und Abfall zu reduzieren, damit Hygiene nachhaltig und einfach wird.</div></div><div class="FullWidthContentBanner-module__8x7Cfa__ctaContainer"><div class="CtaGroup-module__iWEu6G__ctaGroup"><a target="_self" class="Button-module__83rP3W__root Button-module__83rP3W__outlined Button-module__83rP3W__medium Button-module__83rP3W__dark" href="/de/de/nachhaltigkeit"><span class="Button-module__83rP3W__text">Mehr erfahren</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ComponentRenderer-module__v_z8Aa__box"><div class="Container-module__CrcPyG__root"><div><div class="Row-module__3KxSla__root"><div class="Column-module__sVh1-q__column RichText-module__Omsw5a__richText Column-module__sVh1-q__m-12 Column-module__sVh1-q__l-8"><div class="RichTextField-module__13JUJa__rtf"><div>
  <strong>Haftungsausschluss</strong>
</div><ol>
  <li>Im Jahr 2025 durchgeführte Umfrage mit 11.500 Befragten in den USA, UK, DE, FR, MX, CA, ESP, SWE, NL und PL. 54 % der Befragten gaben an, auf Barrieren zu stoßen, weil sie etwa unter diagnostizierten oder selbst diagnostizierten körperlichen oder kognitiven Beschwerden leiden, z. B. Dermatitis, chronische Schmerzen, allgemeine Angstzustände und Klaustrophobie. </li>
</ol></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!-- --><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer><div class="Column-module__sVh1-q__column Column-module__sVh1-q__xs-12 Column-module__sVh1-q__s-0 Column-module__sVh1-q__m-0"><section class="FooterMainContent-module__CVYLRW__root"><div class="FooterMainContent-module__CVYLRW__layoutContainer"><a aria-label="TORK LOGO - To the home page" href="/de/de"><svg width="100" height="67" viewBox="0 0 100 67" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_15817_94023)"><g clip-path="url(#clip1_15817_94023)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M22.6101 56.5772C23.3674 56.5772 23.9673 55.9976 23.9673 55.2608C23.9673 54.524 23.3674 53.9247 22.6101 53.9247C21.8922 53.9247 21.2922 54.524 21.2922 55.2608C21.2922 55.9976 21.8922 56.5772 22.6101 56.5772ZM21.4693 66.3129H23.7903V58.7778C23.7903 57.9231 23.4559 57.5498 22.5609 57.5498H21.4693V66.3129ZM6.89423 56.5469V66.312H4.3962V56.5469H2.05552C1.16055 56.5469 0.826172 56.1736 0.826172 55.3189V54.4741H9.23491C10.1299 54.4741 10.4643 54.8474 10.4643 55.7021V56.5469H6.89423ZM12.7851 54.4741C13.6801 54.4741 14.0145 54.8474 14.0145 55.7021V58.6493C14.5554 57.8634 15.3717 57.3132 16.6699 57.3132C18.4303 57.3132 19.6203 58.4528 19.6203 60.7418V66.312H17.2993V61.3214C17.2993 60.0541 16.9846 59.2289 15.8241 59.2289C14.457 59.2289 14.0145 60.4765 14.0145 61.901V66.312H11.6935V54.4741H12.7851ZM26.7311 57.5504C27.6261 57.5504 27.9605 57.9237 27.9605 58.7784V58.798C28.521 57.9237 29.3275 57.3244 30.7044 57.3244C32.4648 57.3244 33.6548 58.464 33.6548 60.753V66.3232H31.3338V61.3326C31.3338 60.0653 31.0191 59.2401 29.8586 59.2401C28.4915 59.2401 28.049 60.4877 28.049 61.9122V66.3232H25.728V57.5602H26.7311V57.5504ZM40.5293 57.549L37.8248 60.899V55.7021C37.8248 54.8474 37.4904 54.4741 36.5954 54.4741H35.5037V66.312H37.8248V62.5396L40.9522 66.312H43.8731L39.8802 61.5179L43.3224 57.549H40.5293ZM52.085 59.0531C51.0819 59.0531 50.4524 59.4067 50.3639 60.2516H48.0626C48.0626 58.2